,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/75fc1c0c-d475-47c9-956f-46257b4580ef.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/13886890-212d-4a66-8d12-2505f22f3fe9.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/e05b0861-246d-46a7-864e-24246633a289.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/73760523301.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/69254523301.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/523301/5233010312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"TCPL Packaging reported its financial and operational results for Q2 and H1 FY2027, highlighting consolidated total income of Rs. 564.6 crore and EBITDA of Rs. 100.1 crore with a 17.7% margin. Management noted strong demand momentum across both paperboard and flexible packaging segments while citing cost pressures from raw materials and logistics. The company recently incorporated TCPL Energy Materials Limited as a wholly owned subsidiary to enter the lithium-ion battery separator films business.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management remains cautious on the near-term export outlook due to continued uncertainty in the global operating environment.","quote":"Our export business also recorded steady year-on-year growth; however, we remain cautious on the near-term outlook given the continuing uncertainty in the global operating environment.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"The existing flexible packaging facility is operating at optimal utilization, supported by strong customer demand.","quote":"Our existing facility is now operating at optimal utilization, supported by strong customer demand.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that revenue growth reflected healthy demand, particularly in the domestic market.","quote":"During the quarter, revenue increased by 16% Y-o-Y, EBITDA grew by 17% and cash profit increased by 56%, reflecting healthy demand, particularly in the domestic market, due to improved operating performance and the benefits of our sustained investments and disciplined execution.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.tcpl.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Earning-Presentation-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf"},{"claim":"Both folding cartons and flexible packaging businesses performed exceptionally well, allowing the company to grow ahead of the market and gain share.","quote":"Both our Folding Cartons and Flexible Packaging businesses performed exceptionally well, enabling us to continue growing ahead of the market and gain share across key segments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.tcpl.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Earning-Presentation-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company initiated the addition of a high speed manufacturing line providing a 30% increase in flexible packaging capacity with an investment of INR 50 crore to INR 60 crore.","quote":"We will be adding about a 30% increase to our existing capacity. You can say that the capacity will increase by about 30%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"The project for lithium-ion battery separator film will be established with a proposed investment of approximately INR 125 crore, deployed over the next 18 months.","quote":"The project will be established through a subsidiary with a proposed investment of approximately INR 125 crore, to be deployed over the next 18 months, with commercial production targeted during Q4 FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"With the existing flexible packaging facility operating at optimal utilisation, TCPL is investing in an additional high speed and capacity line.","quote":"With our existing Flexible Packaging facility now operating at optimal utilisation, we are investing in an additional high speed and capacity line to support the next phase of growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.tcpl.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Earning-Presentation-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf"},{"claim":"The company announced a strategic entry into the battery materials business through a proposed subsidiary to manufacture lithium-ion battery separator films.","quote":"Alongside the continued expansion of our core packaging business, we are pleased to announce strategic entry into the battery materials business through a subsidiary proposed to be incorporated for the manufacture of lithium-ion battery separator films.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.tcpl.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Earning-Presentation-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Consolidated total income increased by 16% year-on-year to INR 495 crore, while EBITDA grew by 17% to INR 88 crore with margins improving to 18%.","quote":"During the first quarter, we delivered a record quarterly performance, with consolidated total income increasing by 16% year-on-year to INR 495 crore, while EBITDA grew by 17% to INR 88 crore with margins improving to 18%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"Cash profit increased by 56% year-on-year to INR 76 crore and PAT grew by nearly 79% year-on-year to INR 40 crore.","quote":"Cash profit increased by 56% year-on-year to INR 76 crore, while PAT grew by nearly 79% year-on-year to INR 40 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"},{"claim":"Improved efficiencies, better utilisation and a richer product mix contributed to sustained margin expansion.","quote":"• Improved efficiencies, better utilisation and a richer product mix contributed to sustained margin expansion","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.tcpl.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Earning-Presentation-Q1-FY-2026-27.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Brand owners are not adopting the change towards mono-material packaging as quickly as expected.","quote":"Concern is more that brand owners are not adopting the change towards mono material packaging with the kind of speed that we were expecting when we put the investment.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Commercial production for the lithium-ion battery separator film project is targeted during Q4 FY28.","quote":"The project will be established through a subsidiary with a proposed investment of approximately INR 125 crore, to be deployed over the next 18 months, with commercial production targeted during Q4 FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b65de5b6-73b8-4213-9158-55dfb2e80126.pdf","timeframe":"Q4 FY28"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":13,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":20,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}